          {(a-1)^{5}(a+2)^{2}(2a+1)^{2}}
\]
is equal to
\[
\overline{\!\frac{(b-c)^{3}}{(e-b)^{2}(e-c)}\!}
   =\frac{27\bigl(\tfrac1{a^{3}}-1\bigr)^{3}}
          {\bigl(\tfrac1{a^{3}}-\tfrac3a+2\bigr)^{2}
