Standard calculus techniques show that   $$ \frac{1}{a}+\frac{1}{a+1}+\cdots +\frac{1}{b}\le 1+\ln\left(\frac{b}{a}\right)\le 1+\log_2\left(\frac{b}{a}\right). $$  Therefore, 
