&=\frac{BN}{\cos\angle{EBN}\sin(\angle{BAC}-\angle{EBN})}
&=\frac{BN}{\cos\angle{EBN}\sin(\angle{BAD}+\angle{EBN})}.
\end{align*}Thus  $NM\|BD$  gives us
