&\geq\sum^n_{i=1} \frac{1}{b_i+b_{i+1}}.
\end{align*}

Using the Cauchy-Schwarz Inequality we obtain      $$ \bigg(\sum^n_{i=1} \frac{1}{b_i+b_{i+1}}\bigg)[(b_1+b_2)+(b_2+b_3)+\cdots +(b_{n-1}+b_n)]\geq (n-1)^2. $$   
