Suppose FTSOC that  $c<1$ . Then we can pick arbitrarily large  $n$  such that  $0\le a_i\le c$  for all  $1\le i\le n$ . Consider a nonincreasing sequence of numbers  $a_{\sigma(1)},a_{\sigma(2)},\dots,a_{\sigma(n)}$ . Note that
