Since  $\triangle CAB$  is isosceles, we already have that  $AC$  is tangent to  $\odot(AIB)$ . Also  $XPFA$  is cyclic since 
\[\measuredangle AXP = \measuredangle AXC = \measuredangle ABC = \measuredangle PFC.\] 
