By lemma 1 and corollary 1,  $v_2 \left(\frac{2^{2^{k-1}} P_2}{(2^k)!}\right) = 1$ . Also, by lemma 2,  $\frac{P_2}{2^{2^{k-1}}} = (2^k - 1)!!$ ,  so we want to show that

