We have that
\begin{align*}
P_3 - (2^k - 1)!! 
&= (2^k + 1)(2^k + 3) \cdots (2^k + 2^k - 1) - (2^k - 1)!! 
&= 2^{3k}(\mbox{some terms}) + (2^k - 1)!!(2^{2k} S_2 + 2^{k-1} S_1) 
&= 2^{3k}(\mbox{some terms}) + (2^k - 1)!!(2^{2k} S_2 + 2^{2k-1} S_3)
