-2^{n-1}\sum_{\substack{1 \leq i \leq 2^ni\text{ odd}}} \frac{1}{i^2} \equiv -2^{n-2} \pmod{2^{2n}}.
\end{align*}
Hence the desired quantity is  $-2^{2n-1} \equiv 2^{2n-1} \pmod{2^{2n}}$ ; done.  $\blacksquare$

