&\equiv (-1)^m \sum_{k=1}^{a_1} \frac{k^2(k-1)(k-2)\cdots(k-m)}{m!} 
&\equiv \frac{(-1)^m}{m+1} \sum_{k=1}^{a_1} k \cdot {k \choose m+1} 
&\equiv \frac{(-1)^m}{m+1} \sum_{k=1}^{a_1} (k+1){k \choose m+1} - \sum_{k=1}^{a_1} {k \choose m+1} 
&\equiv \frac{(-1)^m}{m+1} \left(\frac 1{m+2} \sum_{k=1}^{a_1} {k+1 \choose m+2} - \sum_{k=1}^{a_1} {k \choose m + 1}\right) 
