\begin{align*}
\dfrac{TB}{TC} &= \dfrac{TB}{TA} \cdot \dfrac{TA}{TC} 
&= \dfrac{BF}{FA} \cdot \dfrac{AE}{EC} 
&= \dfrac{BF}{CE} 
&= \dfrac{XB}{XC}
\end{align*}
where the last equality arises from spiral similarities. We are thus done.</details>

