These things imply  $VM \cdot VC = VA^2 = VY \cdot VK$  so  $CKYM$  is cyclic.  $\blacksquare$ Note that the last part also implies  $\measuredangle MYH = \measuredangle NKC$  and  $\measuredangle HXN = \measuredangle BLM$ , so if we let  $\odot (CKM)$  meet  $AH$  again at  $Z_1$  and similarly define  $Z_2$ , we get 
